    "title": "TDF use with hypertension risk",
    "message": "Guidelines advise caution with TDF in high-risk patients, particularly those with co-existent hypertension. This patient has hypertension (BP 146/94) and trace proteinuria, indicating possible renal stress. TDF is associated with renal failure and tubular wasting syndrome. The combination of TDF, hypertension, and NSAID use (ibuprofen) compounds renal risk. Non-drug causes like hypertension itself can contribute to proteinuria.",
